    {
     "kind": "power",
     "note": "Nab (2) summons a Stuffed Sack (0/3) for the boss that holds the minion out of play; the wiki gives no rules for it. Here: the minion itself is set aside, with its damage and enchantments, and returns to its own controller's board when the sack's Deathrattle resolves, whoever controls the sack; with that board full it is lost, and a silenced, transformed or bounced sack never returns it. Nab needs a free slot on the boss's board. A run player's board shrine is never a legal target (a shrine never enters a sack)."
    },
    {
     "kind": "power",
     "note": "Sack of Gnomes (4), \"Fill your board with random Gnomes\": the client data names no pool. Here one random minion per free slot from the collectible Gnomes by name at the time of The Witchwood (Leper Gnome, Clockwork Gnome, Gnomish Inventor, Gnomish Experimenter, Gnomeregan Infantry, Gnomeferatu), those scripted and allowed by the run's generation filter."
    }
